      "writtenOn": "2021-09-02T07:16:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t handle RX_BUF_OVF anywhere currently. I split this CL for more rapid deployment.\n\nSee crrev/c/2420477 for only some of the changes necessary to achieve this.\n\nRETURN is not used because TCPCI v1.0 FIFO may have unknown depth. (In TCPCI r2.0 this was constrained to \"2\".) We may need to \"flush out\" multiple FIFO packets rapidly. Iterating until ALERT# RX_STATUS is cleared achieves this.",
      "parentUuid": "9478a37c_ca79cced",
